    "TPS6282xA": "Rev I, section 8.2.2.5 / p14: 10uF effective output; table 8-3 / p13 includes 0.47uH with 47uF nominal, anticipates +20/-35% capacitance variation. 47*0.65=30.55uF is the lower edge of that nominal-row assumed variation, not a replacement for the separate 10uF floor.",
    "TPS628640B": "Rev C, section 9.2.1.2.5 / p22: recommended minimum 30uF effective output; table 9-3 / p21 includes 0.24uH with 3x22uF, anticipates +20/-30% capacitance variation. 66*0.70=46.2uF is that row lower edge. If the combined application envelope falls outside the anticipated row, independent loop/transient validation is required.",
    "voltage": "CPU/KPU 56.2k start selection gives 0.8V. 1.675V is the converter register endpoint only; it is outside the existing K230 0.72-0.88V screen and is not an approved SoC voltage.",
    "current": "Converter ratings are CORE 4A, DDR 3A, 1V8 2A, 3V3 3A, CPU/KPU 4A each; these are not capacitor ripple ratings or demonstrated installed rail capacity. TPS62864 warns reduced lifetime at continuous 4A with junction above105C."
  },
